{"parentUuid": null, "isSidechain": false, "promptId": "54ff5222-0ca0-4b06-aa5e-5cab1cda91ca", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "The library-lending app is in your current working directory. Something keeps coming up at the desk and I'd like to do something about it eventually.\n\nMembers can only pay their fines in person, at one of our two desks. We have about 3,000 members at one branch. The nightly job assesses the fines, and members can already see and renew their loans in the portal, but they still have to come in just to pay \u2014 and the desk staff spend part of every shift taking small card payments. We take cards through Stripe already and I don't want to change that. I'm the only developer on this. I guess we'd just add a pay button to the portal?\n\nBefore we do anything about it, capture the problem and save it as `docs/pay-fine/problem.md`.\n"}, "uuid": "58501be5-e491-476e-a3b4-e34a1ec2f2e3", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T11:40:22.064Z", "permissionMode": "dontAsk", "promptSource": "sdk", "turnOrigin": "sdk", "turnPosition": {"promptIndex": 0, "turnIndex": 1}, "userType": "external", "entrypoint": "sdk-cli", "cwd": ".", "sessionId": "af903dbe-6e68-4ff3-8d0b-3d36aa9ac242", "version": "2.1.325", "gitBranch": "main"}
